# Proposed root cron.d entries, UTC. Enable only after remote setup and a verified dry run.
# The existing daily cron is retained; do not install a duplicate daily job.
# 30 3 * * * root /usr/local/sbin/nhcemeteries-test-backup
# Weekly local retention: archives and verifies every selected byte before removal.
# 30 5 * * 0 root /usr/local/sbin/nhcemeteries-test-backup-retention maintain
# Offsite daily-snapshot retention; recovery-hold archives are not selected.
# 30 6 * * 0 root /usr/local/sbin/nhcemeteries-test-backup-retention expire --apply
# Monthly readback of all repository data. Monitor exit status and freshness separately.
# 30 7 1 * * root /usr/local/sbin/nhcemeteries-test-backup-retention check
